# Source licence and scope

The unmodified MIT licence in LICENSES/MIT.txt applies to project-authored
software and documentation only to the extent the contributors own or are
authorised to license that material.

The MIT grant does not cover reconstructed proprietary game expressions,
recovered text/tables, annotations or other original-derived evidence, original
game artwork/audio/data, trademarks, or documentation screenshots containing
original game material. Third-party dependencies retain their own licences.

No rights in excluded material are granted. A legally obtained original game
installation is required. See NOTICE.md and LICENSES/README.md before reuse or
redistribution. This independent preservation/research project is not an
official release and is not endorsed by the game's rights holders.
